#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "488_Player"
msgid "You're not doing so well... You'll just have to try harder."
msgstr "No se te está dando muy bien... Tienes que esforzarte más."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "500_キャバ育名前"
msgid "Okay, I'll try..."
msgstr "Lo intentaré..."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "524_Player"
msgid "Good work out there tonight. I think you're getting the hang of things."
msgstr "Buen trabajo el de esta noche. Creo que le estás agarrando el truco."

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "536_キャバ育名前"
msgid "I'm glad to hear you say that. I hope I can keep improving."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "560_Player"
msgid "Great job out there tonight. I could tell you were giving it your all."
msgstr "Buen trabajo ahí fuera. Se nota que estábais dandolo todo."

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "572_キャバ育名前"
msgid "Thank you, I was really trying!"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "608_Player"
msgid "Let's work on your presentation. Makeup, hair, posture...\\r\nAll of these things send certain signals to a man."
msgstr "Vamos a trabajar en tu presentación. Maquillaje, peinado, postura...\\r\nTodas estas cosas envían ciertas señales a un hombre."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "620_キャバ育名前"
msgid "Okay. Let's get started."
msgstr "Bien. Empecemos."

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "644_Player"
msgid "All right, you're looking good. Way to go."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "656_キャバ育名前"
msgid "Thank you. It's all thanks to your help!"
msgstr "Gracias. ¡Todo gracias a tu ayuda!"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "680_Player"
msgid "Hmm... You still need a bit of work."
msgstr "Mmm... Aún tienes que mejorar."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "692_キャバ育名前"
msgid "I'm sorry... I'll try harder next time."
msgstr "Lo siento... Me esforzaré más la próxima vez."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "716_Player"
msgid "Okay, so today we're going to study a little trivia. No\\r\nmatter what the conversation, it's always important to be\\r\nsmart about what you say. \"Knowledge is power,\" right?"
msgstr "Bien, hoy vamos a estudiar un poco. No importa cuál\\r\nsea la conversación, siempre es importante ser inteligente\\r\ncon lo que dices. \"El conocimiento es poder\", ¿verdad?"

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "728_キャバ育名前"
msgid "You're definitely right. Let's do this!"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "752_Player"
msgid "You're doing very well. Good job."
msgstr "Lo estás haciendo muy bien. Buen trabajo."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "764_キャバ育名前"
msgid "Thank you. It's all thanks to your help!"
msgstr "Gracias. ¡Todo gracias a tu ayuda!"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "788_Player"
msgid "Hmm... You still need a bit of work."
msgstr "Mmm... Aún tienes que mejorar."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "800_キャバ育名前"
msgid "I'm sorry... I'll try harder next time."
msgstr "Lo siento... Me esforzaré más la próxima vez."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "824_Player"
msgid "Right now, I'd like to give you some conversation tips to\\r\nhelp you captivate the customers. Sound good?"
msgstr "Ahora me gustaría darte algunos consejos de conversación\\r\npara ayudarte a cautivar a los clientes. ¿Te parece bien?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "836_キャバ育名前"
msgid "That does sound good. I'll be taking mental notes."
msgstr "Eso suena bien. Tomo nota."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "860_Player"
msgid "You're doing very well. Good job."
msgstr "Lo estás haciendo muy bien. Buen trabajo."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "872_キャバ育名前"
msgid "Thank you. It's all thanks to your help!"
msgstr "Gracias. ¡Todo gracias a tu ayuda!"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "896_Player"
msgid "Hmm... You still need a bit of work."
msgstr "Mmm... Aún tienes que mejorar."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "908_キャバ育名前"
msgid "I'm sorry... I'll try harder next time."
msgstr "Lo siento... Me esforzaré más la próxima vez."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "932_Player"
msgid "I think you should spend your downtime doing whatever you like. Relax."
msgstr "Creo que deberías pasar tu tiempo libre haciendo lo que quieras. Relajate."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "944_キャバ育名前"
msgid "Really? Thank you!"
msgstr "¿En serio? ¡Gracias!"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "968_Player"
msgid "Did you make the most of your time? You seem pretty relaxed now."
msgstr "¿Te la pasaste bien? Te ves bastante bien."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "980_キャバ育名前"
msgid "Yes! I feel a lot better."
msgstr "¡Sí! Me siento mucho mejor."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "1004_Player"
msgid "Well? Had a good rest?"
msgstr "Bueno... ¿Has descansado bien?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "1016_キャバ育名前"
msgid "No, I couldn't relax for some reason."
msgstr "No, por alguna razón no me pude relajar."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "1040_Player"
msgid "Today, we're going to work on your weak points. Now I know I\\r\nmight come off a little blunt, but bear with it, okay?"
msgstr "Vamos a mejorar tus puntos débiles. Sé que puedo\nllegar a ser un poco brusco, pero tenme paciencia, ¿sí?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "1052_キャバ育名前"
msgid "All right..."
msgstr "Claro..."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "1076_Player"
msgid "All right, now think about what I told you and give it your full effort next time."
msgstr "Muy bien, ahora piensa en lo que te he dicho y esfuérzate al máximo la próxima vez."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "1088_キャバ育名前"
msgid "I will. Thank you!"
msgstr "Lo haré. Gracias!"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "1112_Player"
msgid "(I don't think any of that really got through to her...)"
msgstr "(No creo que haya llegado a entenderlo...)."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "1124_キャバ育名前"
msgid "......"
msgstr "......"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "1148_Player"
msgid "I think you should take some time off for yourself and relax for a bit."
msgstr "Creo que deberías tomarte un tiempo y relajarte un poco."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "1160_キャバ育名前"
msgid "Okay!"
msgstr "¡Está bien!"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "1184_Player"
msgid "How was it? Did you get some relaxing in?"
msgstr "¿Y bien? ¿Te sientes mucho mejor ahora?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "1196_キャバ育名前"
msgid "Oh, yes! Thank you!"
msgstr "Oh sí. ¡Gracias!"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "1220_Player"
msgid "Did you have a good break?"
msgstr "¿Descansaste bien?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "1232_キャバ育名前"
msgid "Not really..."
msgstr "En realidad no..."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "1256_Player"
msgid "Today, we're going to find a way to keep you motivated and positive. Sound good?"
msgstr "Hoy vamos a encontrar la manera en que te sientas motivada y positiva. ¿Qué te parece?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "1268_キャバ育名前"
msgid "All right. I can get behind that!"
msgstr "Sí. ¡Puedo hacerlo!"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "1292_Player"
msgid "What do you think? Are you feeling any more positive?"
msgstr "¿Qué tal? ¿Te sientes mucho mejor?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "1304_キャバ育名前"
msgid "Oh, yes! Thank you!"
msgstr "Oh sí. ¡Gracias!"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "1328_Player"
msgid "What do you think? Feeling positive?"
msgstr "¿Qué tal? ¿Te sientes más optimista?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "1340_キャバ育名前"
msgid "Not really..."
msgstr "En realidad no..."

